# Frontend React conventions

- Place pages in the correct zone (`pages/app`, `pages/admin`, `pages/search`, `pages/landing`) and register in `routes/AppRoutes.tsx` under the matching shell + guard.
- Use Redux slices + typed hooks; call backend only through `services/api.ts` `*API` helpers.
- Auth: tokens via storage utils; refresh via `services/authSession.ts` (no ad-hoc full reload on 401).
- Layout: reuse `PageShell` / `layout/constants.ts`. App theme: `theme/ledgerCoreTheme.ts`.
- Prefer focused unit tests (slices/utils) over brittle full-page snapshots — `docs/agent-kb/testing.md`.
- After edits: `npx tsc --noEmit` as part of `verify-and-fix`.
